<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45189" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐστοχ-έω</span></b> , pf.
		inf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐστοχηκέναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					2.31
				</span></i>
			:—<i>hit the mark, succeed</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁμαρτάνω</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.14.7
			</span></i>, etc.: c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. πάσης
				περιστάσεως, τῶν καιρῶν, τῆς ἐλπίδος</span>, <i>to
			hit</i> them <i>exactly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.45.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				28.3.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				32.3.10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς εἰσβολῆς τοῦ λιμένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					17.1.6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					5.3.8
				</span></i>
			: c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θηρίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Apollod.
					1.7.4
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				9.12.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ἅπασιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					1.15.1
				</span></i>
			; <i>guess aright</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.617d
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, impers., <i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				44.23.44
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐστοχηθεῖσα χάρις</span>
			blessing <i>seasonably granted</i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				15.9.2
			</span></i>.</div>
